\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0 The day thou gavest, Lord is ended;
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 The darkness falls at thy behest
\par To thee our morning hymns ascended
\par Thy praise shall sanctify our rest.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We thank thee that thy Church unsleeping
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj While earth rolls onward into light
\par Through all the world her watch is keeping
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 And rests from worship day or night.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  As o'er each continent and island
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 The dawn leads on another day
\par The voice of prayer is never silent
\par Nor dies the song of praise away
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The sun that bids us rest is waking
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj our brethren 'neath the western sky
\par And hour by hour fresh lips are making
\par Thou wondrous doings heard on high.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. So be it, Lord; Thy throne shall never
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Like earth's proud empires, pass away
\par Thy Kingdom stands and grows forever
\par \pard     Till all thy creatures own thy sway.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

